Z||000018||Monkeyman||11-03-2001||09:07 AM||||My 1<sup>st</sup> Fiero ('86 coupe) was appropriately named the Monkeymobile.  My second ('85 GT) was purple therefore it was called the Grape Ape.  I never really named my third one (another '85 GT) so my wife and I just called it No Name.  My current ride is an '86 GT (my 1<sup>st</sup> fastback) we call 4Play.  Either it means it's my 4<sup>th</sup> Fiero and it's my play toy or umm...it means, uh.  Well, you figure it out.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||1
