Z||000022||RadRuss||11-03-2001||10:03 AM||||My dads 1970 ford custom pick up is possessed <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"> no lie. It all started when she was stolen from work, to be used in robbery's and drug transportation. The truck was still primered and my dad was waiting for the new engine to come. So he figured it would not be stolen. When my dad got her back she would not start for anyone except him, u couldn't even get the key to turn over. I remember this one time he took it to a paint shop to get it painted and they couldn't get her started so they had to push her every where they needed her. When they were done the owner called my dad and told him what happen and my dad drove down there, put the key in, and started her right up. The guy's mouth hit the floor. One other thing was when my dad would play around with her, he always tell my mom to take her out and test driver her. One day my dad told her that she doesn't like to be smoked in and not to smoke. But she did any ways, and the rearview mirror fell off. There’s a lot more but I don’t want to make this that long. Her name though is MOM.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signiturecar_4.jpg"> ||||reg||10
